# @SIEGE (port_bugs.md #1165): while enemy military land units around a colony outnumber the owner's
# (FUN_2f2b_0000), colonists may leave only as Soldier or Dragoon (FUN_2f2b_011e code 0x14).
# Fixture: three lone English Dragoons (#137-#139; England is at war with France) moved next to
# Guadeloupe (41,24) at (40,23), (40,24), (40,25); France has no military unit there.
# Guadeloupe stock: muskets 100, horses 100. People strip icons: x = 5 + 9*i, y = 155; fence drop (131,112).
click 104 128              # open Guadeloupe
wait 10
drag 32 155 131 112        # colonist 3 -> fence: role popup
click 100 87               # Colonist: refused with @SIEGE
key Return                 # dismiss
drag 32 155 131 112        # colonist 3 -> fence again
click 100 111               # Scout: refused with @SIEGE too
key Return                 # dismiss
drag 32 155 131 112        # colonist 3 -> fence again
click 100 103               # Soldier: allowed, leaves (muskets 100 -> 50), pop 4 -> 3
drag 23 155 131 112        # colonist 2 -> fence
click 100 119               # Dragoon: allowed, leaves (muskets 50 -> 0, horses 100 -> 50), pop 3 -> 2
key Escape                 # leave Guadeloupe
